<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Ndwewe Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Film</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba ali lihupitaho kwa Filimoni likityekwa na nndumila Paulo 1:1. Paulo kakibhegha mu kibhopo pakatyekite lihamba ali, na ayi yingubhoneha kukita pakatyekite lihamba ali ywombe kakibhegha ku kitami kikulu kya Loma. Na handa kakibhegha ku Loma pakatyekite lihamba ali, hino yingubhoneha kukita kakityeka handa ngungwa ya mbinda mabhoko sita na yimo mbole ya kubhelekwa Kilisito, na ndo munndaluko aghwo aghwo kakityeka lihamba kwa Akaakolosai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kakityeka lihamba ali kwa mundu ywakamanyika Filimoni. Filimoni kakibhegha yumoo mu ngwemuko ya bhandu bhaanhyubhalila Kilisito na kangi kakibhegha na abhandwa. Paulo kakintyekela Filimoni ngati kannyupe kukita kakotoke kunkeha nbhandwa ghwake Onesimo ywakatughite kwa Filemoni. Kubhukana na malaghilo gha Akaaloma Filimoni kakibhegha na shaliya ya kunkoma Onesimo. Paulo kangutumila malagho gha kunyegheleha Filimoni ngati kantekule Onesimo handa nnongo ywaanhyubhalilite Kilisito na kangi kanguyupa kukita Onesimo kateghekwe kutenda lihengo papamu na Paulo 1:13-14</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaabheghite</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo kangunnjambuha Filimoni 1:1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo kanguyupa kwa lihombo lya Onesimo kukita Filimoni kankingame Onesimo handa nnongo mu kunhyubhalila Kilisito 1:4-21.</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo kanguyomolela kwa kubhoneha mapalo ghake gha kuntyangila kangi na kuataghila lilobhe lya kuajambuha alongo 1:22-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kangunnjambuha Filimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Lihamba ali linguhuma kwa nenga Paulo, mmopwa kwa kya Kilisito Yesu, na kuhuma kwa Timoti nnongo ghwetu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Tungukutyekela ghwenga npalo Filemoni, nntendalihengo nnyetu, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />na nhacha ghwetu Afia, na machonda nnyetu mu Kilisito Alikipo, papamu na ngwemuko ya bhandu bhaanhyubhalila Kilisito bhaakongana mu lubhagha lwako. <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Tunguayupila umaha na uhihimilo, kuhuma kwa Chapanga Tate ghwetu na kwa Bambo Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upalo na uhyubhalilo kwa Filimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Manjubha ghoha pammegha mu kuyupa, panughukulungwa ghwenga Filimoni nungunnumba Chapanga, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />kiyaha nunguyihwa mihalo ya kuhyubhalila kwako kwa Bambo Yesu na Upalo ghwako kwa bhandu bhoha bhaabhaghulitwe kwa kya Chapanga. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Nunguyupila kukita uhyubhaliolo ghwako ghuulilungite papamu na twenga ghukutange ngati ghubheghe na umanyi ghuukamaliti ghwa nemelo yoha yiitukingamite mu kulilunga kwa twenga nkati ya Kilisito. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Nnongo, upalo ghwako ghunyeleha munu na ghuundengeleha munu! Na ghuyihangaluha myoyo ya bhandu bhaabhaghulitwe kwa kya Chapanga.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luyupo kwa kya Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Kwa kya agho hata handa panughukwilikiha mu Kilisito ghutende kila kighukunogha kutenda, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />peni kwa kya upalo, yingunnogha mbaka nughuyupe. Nungutenda habhu kiyaha nenga Paulo nng'ohi ghwa ngwemuko, na hinu mmopwa kwa kya Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Nungughuyupa kwa kya Onesimo mwana ghwangu, aywo ndo mwana ghwangu mu kunhyubhalila Kilisito kiyaha megha tate ghwake pamegha mukibhopo, <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />pamakachu kakikutangatila ng'obhe kilibhi, peni hinu kangughunogha ghwenga na nenga bhubho.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Hinu nungunlaghila kangi kwa ghwenga, kiyaha nungumpala kwa mwoyo ghwangu ghwoha. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Ningapalite katame na nenga ngati kayikamuhe ng'ebhu yako ya kundangatila mu manjubha agha pamegha mu kibhopo kwa kya Nhalo ghwa Maha, <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />peni nungupala ng'obhe kutenda kyohele kya nga kuteghekwa na ghwenga, ngati yikotoke kubhegha handa ningukukwiliha kundendela gha maha ngati ghutende kwa mwoyo ghwako ghumwene. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Pangi kwa mwene kutama kutali na ghwenga kya manjubha machoko ndo nhokonyo ghwa kutama naywo mu manjubha ghoha, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />chepa handa nbhandwa, ngati ndo ghwa maha kyanalumu ya nbhandwa, na ndo nlongo npalwa mu Kilisito. Mwene ndo npalo ghwangu muno na kangi ghwenga ghwanpala kyanalumu, mwene ndo chepa ghwako ghweka ngati ndo ghwa Chapanga bhubho.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Hinu, handa ghungumanya nenga handa ntenda lihengo nnyako mu Kilisito, ghunkingame handa bhula paghunkingama nenga. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Handa kakuhokela kyohele ebu handa ghunyahika kyohele, nenga ndakubhuyihila. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Nenga Paulo nuutyeka lihamba ali kwa kibhoko kyangu numwene. Ndakubhuyihila. Kangi nungupala ng'obhe kulongela kukita nungukughamba ubhumi ghwako ghumwene. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Hinu nnongo ghwangu, ketaketa ghundendele nlando aghwo kwa kya lihina lya Bambo, ngati ghuuyelele mwoyo ghwangu handa nnongo mu Kilisito.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Nungukutyekela panhyubhalila kukita ghwanyitikila na kunu pamanya kukita ghwaatenda kupitingana kwa ghala ghanughuyupa. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Megha na liyupo limo kyanalumu, ghuntendekehele kyumba kya ahenja, kiyaha nungupala kubhuyihwa kwa mwenga handa luyango lwa mayupo ghenu.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majambuho gha muuhiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafula, mmopwa nnyangu kwa kya Kilisito Yesu, kangukujambuha. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Bhubho Maliki, na Alisitaliko, na Dema na Lukasi, atenda lihengo ayangu, bhangukujambua. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Nungubhayupila mabhoha umaha ghwa Bambo Yesu Kilisito ghubheghe papamu na mwenga.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>